r back on your way to the bottom of Nadir, taking time to admire its horrific look. It might feel familiar \u2013 from the wonders of the Divine Comedy, to desaturated aesthetics of Sin City, to the unforgettable design of Hellboy \u2013 yet not comfortable at all.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1535210/extras/4d58607781cb257212c08be7a2785661.poster.avif?t=1668683329\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1535210/extras/4d58607781cb257212c08be7a2785661.webm?t=1668683329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1535210/extras/4d58607781cb257212c08be7a2785661.mp4?t=1668683329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
